    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning two bedroom second floor open plan dual aspect apartment with a stylish interior ideally located in the heart of Smithfield.\r\n\r\nThis amazing property features an L shaped entrance hall with laminate floors and a hotpress. To the right of the hallway are two spacious double bedrooms with sophisticated fitted wardrobes and laminate floors. The recently refurbished bathroom boasts high spec sanitary ware and built in storage. The light filled dual aspect living room, dining area and kitchen enjoys an open plan layout which maximises the space. The eye catching kitchen comes with plenty of counter & cupboard space and there is also the added bonus of a sunny balcony which the perfect place to relax. This amazing apartment benefits from a secure designated car space and is serviced by a lift.\r\n\r\nThe New Hardwicke is an attractive red brick development ideally located just a short stroll from Smithfield Square. There are lots of cafes, shops, bars & restaurants closeby and the Red Line LUAS provides east access to the city centre which is also within walking distance.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nYear of construction 1991\r\nService charge €1937\r\nOpen plan\r\nDual aspect\r\nDesignated car space\r\nSunny balcony\r\nSought after location\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nHigh spec bathroom\r\nLaminate floors\r\nNo rent caps"
      },
      {
